WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.856
To put the impact in numbers: TimeSiam reduces
average forecasting error by five point

00:00:05.936 --> 00:00:10.619
seven percent on PatchTST and two point five
percent on iTransformer,

00:00:10.699 --> 00:00:16.762
and raises classification accuracy by eleven point
five percent in the in-domain setting,

00:00:16.842 --> 00:00:19.384
all relative to training from scratch.

00:00:19.464 --> 00:00:25.389
It does this across thirteen benchmarks covering
forecasting and classification in both

00:00:25.469 --> 00:00:27.874
in-domain and cross-domain settings,

00:00:27.954 --> 00:00:32.568
and it outperforms eight state-of-the-art
self-supervised baselines.

00:00:32.648 --> 00:00:35.467
Backing the cross-domain story is TSLD-1G,

00:00:35.547 --> 00:00:42.300
a newly built pre-training dataset with nearly
fourteen million examples spanning multiple domains.
